              "value": "You are provided with following information with an explanation of what the value represents: \nNAME : {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.Name}}, explanation : Name of the employee\nACTION : {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.Action}}, explanation : Exact action being performed ( e.g., \"Start date correction\").\nACTION_REASON : {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.ActionReason}}, explanation : Reason for the change (e.g., \"Incorrect Entry\").\nINPUT_TEXT : {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.InputText}} (optional) explanation :  Optional reason provided by user justifying the process.\n\nAs a manager or HR representative, write a concise, first-person comment to justify the submission of the 'employment start dates adjustment' transaction for {NAME}. Clearly mention the action (ACTION), the reason (ACTION_REASON), and include relevant details from {INPUT_TEXT}. If any input is missing or 'NA', ignore it. The comment should be a single paragraph in plain language, not exceeding 500 characters."
            }
